  exerciseText: Saving is not storing amounts, and it's crashing on Load
  hintText: Check the save Json, is everything being saved?
  solutionText: PlayerGathering.SaveObject is not marked as Serializable. It needs
    that attribute otherwise it gets ignored when being parsed into Json
